  m_ExampleName: Bounce Ragdolls
  m_Category: Benchmarks
  m_Purpose: "Ragdolls dropped one at a time into a closed room of very bouncy walls and bumpers, while gravity slowly swings around the room.\nIt checks that very fast continuous collision stays stable for a body made of many shapes and joints."
  m_Controls: "Update Period: how often a ragdoll is dropped.\nRagdoll Count: how many ragdolls are dropped.\nGravity Scale: how strong the swinging gravity is."
  m_Description: Checking the stability of very fast continuous collision.
